  "709b431e-ea04-419a-98dc-367fdea844ee"],
 " = c0 diag[1 + (4 \[CurlyEpsilon]/5)(2E - ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["e", 
    StyleBox["i",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f2d797ca-5c82-4f50-8d8e-e5fa2f9fa400"],
 ")], independent of a"
